Strategic alliances, acquisitions, joint ventures and new hires involve a number of operational, regulatory, and
financial risks and challenges, including:
• potential disruption of our ongoing businesses and product and service and market development and distraction of
management;
• difficulty retaining and integrating personnel and integrating administrative, operational, financial reporting,
internal control, compliance, and other systems;
• the necessity of hiring additional management and other critical personnel and integrating them into current
operations;
